POC Objective

The objective of the POC is to demonstrate a scalable and extensible metadata-driven Data Quality framework where:

New datasets can be onboarded through configuration.
Existing DQ rules can be assigned without modifying core engine logic.
Multiple source systems can be supported through pluggable source readers.
New rule types can be introduced through reusable plug-in functions while preserving the common execution lifecycle.

This implementation has been aligned to the target architecture shared earlier and uses GCP with Databricks (PySpark) as the primary implementation platform.

